description = Color(Because of [PAWN_possessive] hacking skills, [PAWN_nameDef] was recruited by [PAWN_possessive] home planet's governing body to serve as an intelligence agent. The government trained [PAWN_objective] in combat, but [PAWN_pronoun] prefers psychological warfare.\n\nGovernment rules proved too strict for [PAWN_objective], so [PAWN_pronoun] went rogue. [PAWN_possessive] current activities are unknown.)
